// Trees that give logs (289 normal_tree_table). Each has 289's category and
// hidden op; 289's `ent` param is left off, as 2011 has no ents to spawn
// (2011 wiki, Woodcutting: superseded by Evil Trees).
//
// Stumps: the pairing void-634 gives (trees.objs.toml) where it has the tree,
// else 289's where its stump still stands in 2011, else the one 647 used
// before this port.

